strong enough  to shatter a block of steel in terms of  involving imagination in this ability  all of gear fourth in general is pretty  beyond what rubber should be able to do  but what always stands out to me as  being especially strange is kong organ  or monkey king murder of crow's cannon  in english which just doesn't roll off  the tongue the same way this attack sees  luffy moving his arms from side to side  so fast that it looks like he has three  arms on each side and each of them uses  kong gun moving on to our fifth form  though we have tank man which is  something this was only really used  against cracker on whole cake island and  it has luffy taking on a much more  defensive gear forth that uses the  quickly burning metabolism that gear  fourth causes in order to keep eating  more and more of crackers biscuit  soldiers the form doesn't really offer  much outside of appetite and defense but  there is a pretty substantial jump in  both of those cracker was previously  able to stab into bound man but as tank  man his attacks are completely useless  so if bound man is power and tank man is  durability then snake man form number  six is all about speed while luffy's  legs and arms are a little bit bigger  the rest of him stays fairly normal in  size on top of that hockey doesn't seem  to spread across the entire limb like it  does with bound men and stops about  two-thirds of the way through because of  the lack of inflation in this form  though luffy is much more vulnerable to  damage in comparison to the other two  but that's not that big a problem when  you consider just how fast this form is  and that in an emergency luffy can  always switch between forms luffy's  attacks in snake man are much faster and  while they do deal less damage than  bound man might offer it's much more  concentrated which can make up for it  the true utility of this form is python  with this luffy can redirect his punches  in mid-air and allow them to build up  more and more speed and momentum as well  as adjust his attacks if they're dodged  basically turning his punches into  honing attacks that do more damage the  longer they're trying to hit the target  the snake man version of gum gum pistol  which takes python into account is  culverin or great serpent cannon and  it's kind of his go-to in this form  although we do see a couple upgraded  attacks as well all of these forms take  advantage of luffy's imaginations in  some way or another turning his basic  rubber abilities into things which are  almost incomparable when placed next to  each other it's like showing someone a  bike and they make you a car the  function of going from point a to point  b is the same but the ability the form  and the capacity are just not even in  the same league and that leads us to  luffy's newest form and his most  powerful one by far  gear five goro say explained that in  this awakened state the nika fruit's  powers are only limited by luffy's  imagination and he can effectively do  anything something which we see being  shown off as he moves and interacts with  the world kind of like a looney tune  character luffy in his sun god state  gets what looks like flaming hair but  aside from that his form seems to be  pretty similar to his basic form he also  seems to always be laughing and smiling  which is likely where the title of joy  boy comes in while we've only seen bits  of this form so far this form does seem  to easily hold up with and overcome  kaido by breaking the laws of the world  around them to fit luffy's imagination  turning the floor into rubber and  bending it up to deflect kaido's boro  breath luffy can enlarge his body and  coil it around kaido and he can even  swing kaido around so fast that it looks  like his eyes are popping out of his  head basically if a looney tune could do  it so can luffy just as with every new  form though this will likely come at a  pretty substantial cost and if i had to  guess it could be pretty close to fatal  gear 2 saw luffy shortening his lifespan  and becoming worn out with excessive use  gear 3 shrunk his body and after his  last attack on lucci left him unable to  move gear 4 leaves him unconscious  sometimes for several days  and if it keeps escalating gear 5 might  cause something much more significant  but we'll have to wait and see the idea  of luffy's fruit being a mythical zone  though makes every aspect of his  abilities feel totally different and in  some ways much more understandable the  focus on different forms something which  we haven't really seen other paramecia  do very often if at all mixed in with  this imaginative understanding of how  rubber could be possibly used definitely  helps us paint a picture of how luffy's  attacks came into being while some  people might feel like the model nika  fruit came out of nowhere i think it's  the final piece of the puzzle that we  needed to fully understand or get a  grasp on luffy's powers  but what do you guys think do you like  the model nika change or do you hate it  or maybe you just think we need more  time to really see how it shakes out as  for luffy's other forms which one's your  favorite for me i love gear 4 but  there's something always so cool about  second gear it's just so satisfying for  me that said though if gear 5 continues  to be as amazing as it was in the first  chapter there it might be a pretty easy  number one for me either way let me know  in the comments regardless let me know  what you guys think in the comments  if you enjoyed this video remember to  leave a like it really does help with  the youtube algorithm as well as helping  us to focus in on the content that you  want to see  and be sure to subscribe and ring the  bell so you don't miss any of the other  great videos coming your way you can  also follow us on twitter and instagram  at anime uproar or if you're looking for  more of me you can find me over on my  own channel axle beats thank you guys so  much for watching i hope you enjoyed and  until next time  remember to stay excellent
 

